BinomialEdgeIdeals -- binomial edge ideals
******************************************

Description
===========

BinomialEdgeIdeals is a package for computations with binomial edge ideals

Literature 
  * [HHHTR2010] Binomial edge ideals and conditional independence statements
    (J. Herzog, T. Hibi, F. Hreinsdottir, T. Kahle, J. Rauh, 2010).
  * [HMMW2014] On the ideal of orthogonal representations of a graph in R^2 (J.
    Herzog, A. Macchia, S. Madani, V. Welker, 2014).
  * [KSW2015] Parity binomial edge ideals (T. Kahle, C. Sarmiento, T. Windisch,
    2015)

Author
======

  * Tobias Windisch (see http://www.uni-magdeburg.de/windisch/ )
    <windisch@ovgu.de>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.0 of BinomialEdgeIdeals, released April
2015.

