disconnectors -- Disconnectors of a graph
*****************************************

  * Usage: 
        disconnectors G
  * Inputs:
      * G, a Graph or a List
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * EffectiveOnly (missing documentation) => ..., default value false, 
  * Outputs:
      * the disconnectors of G

Description
===========

This routine computes the disconnectors of the parity binomial edge ideal and
the permanental binomial edge ideal of G
+---------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G={{1,2},{2,3},{3,1}}                   |
|                                             |
|o1 = {{1, 2}, {2, 3}, {3, 1}}                |
|                                             |
|o1 : List                                    |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i2 : d = disconnectors(G)                    |
|                                             |
|o2 = {{}, {1}, {2}, {3}}                     |
|                                             |
|o2 : List                                    |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i3 : d = disconnectors(G,EffectiveOnly=>true)|
|                                             |
|o3 = {{}, {3}, {2}, {1}}                     |
|                                             |
|o3 : List                                    |
+---------------------------------------------+

